# ---- secrets: NEVER commit ----
.env
*.key
*.pem

# ---- data: large, regenerable, and NOT yours to republish ----
# data/ reaches 2-6 GB and the graffiti CSVs contain arbitrary text
# pulled off the blockchain. Publishing that text under your name is a
# different act from publishing code that measures it. Regenerate
# locally with the builders instead.
data/
scratch/

# Generated dashboard data. The SLOW files (cumulative, monthlies, meta)
# are committed: they ship with the site so a clone renders without a
# node, and they only change when the chain is re-scanned. The LIVE pair
# is written every block and goes to R2 instead — committing it would
# mean a commit per block, forever.
dashboard/data/live.json
dashboard/data/live_history.json

# ---- python ----
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# ---- os / editor ----
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- notes ----
*.docx
~$*
